A reference definition's metadata slots take exactly one space

```
[a]: /u  "T"

[a][]
.
<p><a href="/u">a</a></p>
```

```
[a]: /u  {.c}

[a][]
.
<p><a href="/u">a</a></p>
```

```
[a]: /u "T"

[a][]
.
<p><a href="/u" title="T">a</a></p>
```

```
[a]: /u {.c}

[a][]
.
<p><a href="/u" class="c">a</a></p>
```
